# Milestone 2 (X6): the Worktrees side-panel section on the linear fixture, dark, 1280x720. Four linked worktrees are
# added through the same operations the Add worktree dialog uses (new branch, new branch from HEAD, detached, locked),
# then the section, the row and header menus, the dialog, a worktree opened in its own tab, a vanished (prunable)
# worktree and Prune, Remove, and the branch menu of the freed branch with "Create worktree...". Compare with spec 21
# section 5.7 and the side-panel layout (07 section 6).
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
open repository linear
wait idle
assert worktree count 1
worktree add $REPOS/linear-login new feature/login
wait idle
worktree add $REPOS/linear-hotfix new hotfix/crash from head
wait idle
worktree add $REPOS/linear-v1 detach head
wait idle
worktree add $REPOS/linear-release new release/1.0 lock Release candidate frozen
wait idle
assert worktree count 5
assert worktree linear-login branch feature/login
assert worktree linear-v1 detached
assert worktree linear-release locked
shot m2-x6-01-section-collapsed
expand worktrees section
wait idle
shot m2-x6-02-section-expanded
open worktree menu linear-login at 130 520
wait idle
shot m2-x6-03-row-menu
close menu
open worktree menu linear-release at 130 540
wait idle
shot m2-x6-04-row-menu-locked
close menu
open worktrees menu at 130 420
wait idle
shot m2-x6-05-header-menu
close menu
open dialog add-worktree
assert dialog open
wait idle
shot m2-x6-06-add-dialog
close dialog
wait idle
open worktree linear-login
wait idle
assert tab count 2
assert tab title linear-login
shot m2-x6-07-worktree-tab
select tab 1
wait idle
worktree vanish linear-hotfix
wait idle
assert worktree linear-hotfix prunable
shot m2-x6-08-prunable
worktree prune
wait idle
assert worktree count 4
worktree unlock linear-release
wait idle
assert worktree linear-release unlocked
worktree remove linear-release
wait idle
assert worktree count 3
shot m2-x6-09-after-remove
# release/1.0 is free again: its branch menu offers "Create worktree..." right after "Checkout branch".
open context menu branch release/1.0 at 130 200
wait idle
shot m2-x6-10-branch-menu-create-worktree
close menu
assert no error
